abstract: "Verified drop-off and pick-up charges at 29 UK airports: fee, free period, overstay penalty, payment method and deadline, drop-off zone location, pick-up rules, Blue Badge arrangements, fee history and free alternative, each row dated and sourced to the airport's own published charges."
